# Buildkite PR Tracking List
# 
# Add PRs to track, one per line.
# Format: repo:pr_number  OR  just pr_number (uses default repo)
#
# Examples:
# canva/canva:12345
# canva/other-repo:67890
# 11111
#
# Manage this file with:
#   bk-track add 12345           # Add PR
#   bk-track rm 12345            # Remove PR
#   bk-track list                # List all
#   bk-track status              # Show status
#
# This file is auto-created when you first run: bk-track add <pr>

